            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#254b6e' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Key Analytical Insights</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#254b6e' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>• Customer acquisition remained consistent from 2019–2025, with approximately 7K new customers each year. </run>
